@base = http://127.0.0.1:8080
@csrf = COPY_CSRF_FROM_LOGIN
@appId = COPY_APPLICATION_ID
@revision = 1
@offerId = COPY_CURRENT_OFFER_ID
@offerHash = COPY_CURRENT_OFFER_HASH
@bundleHash = COPY_ACCEPTED_BUNDLE_HASH
@contractId = COPY_CONTRACT_ID
@quoteId = COPY_QUOTE_ID

### 1. Login; the HTTP client must keep the session cookie.
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"good@demo.local","password":"Demo2026!"}

### 2. Organization, templates, live versions and clock.
GET {{base}}/api/v2/workspace?organization_id=demo-org-a

### 3. Only on a clean demo organization / when no unfinished submitted application exists.
POST {{base}}/api/v2/applications
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Idempotency-Key: example-draft-unique-001

{"organization_id":"demo-org-a","template_id":"FIX-A"}

### 4. Confirm synthetic forecast. Copy current revision after every successful command.
PUT {{base}}/api/v2/applications/{{appId}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Idempotency-Key: example-edit-unique-001
If-Match: {{revision}}

{"expected_version":{{revision}},"input":{"product_code":"DEMO_TERM_LOAN_V1","amount_kopecks":200000000,"term_months":12,"financials_confirmed":true}}

### 5. Separate processing consent.
POST {{base}}/api/v2/applications/{{appId}}/commands
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Idempotency-Key: example-processing-consent-001

{"action":"consent","expected_version":{{revision}},"purpose":"DATA_PROCESSING","confirmed":true}

### 6. Separate credit-history consent.
POST {{base}}/api/v2/applications/{{appId}}/commands
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Idempotency-Key: example-history-consent-001

{"action":"consent","expected_version":{{revision}},"purpose":"CREDIT_HISTORY","confirmed":true}

### 7. Submit. Repeating this exact key/body returns the original receipt.
POST {{base}}/api/v2/applications/{{appId}}/commands
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Idempotency-Key: example-submit-001

{"action":"submit","expected_version":{{revision}}}

### 8. Poll persisted state; no external bank request is sent.
GET {{base}}/api/v2/applications/{{appId}}

### 9. Explicit acceptance of current version/hash.
POST {{base}}/api/v2/applications/{{appId}}/commands
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Idempotency-Key: example-accept-001

{"action":"accept","expected_version":{{revision}},"offer_id":"{{offerId}}","offer_hash":"{{offerHash}}","confirmed":true}

### 10. Review documents before simulated signing.
GET {{base}}/api/v2/applications/{{appId}}/bundle

### 11. Simulation only. The persisted worker automatically executes once.
POST {{base}}/api/v2/applications/{{appId}}/commands
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Idempotency-Key: example-sign-001

{"action":"sign","expected_version":{{revision}},"bundle_hash":"{{bundleHash}}","confirmed":true}

### 12. Schedule / debt / synthetic account.
GET {{base}}/api/v2/contracts/{{contractId}}

### 13. Only once the first payment date is reached through authorized demo clock.
POST {{base}}/api/v2/contracts/{{contractId}}/commands
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Idempotency-Key: example-pay-preview-001

{"action":"pay_preview","expected_version":{{revision}}}

### 14. Quote confirmation; must have current clock and contract revisions.
POST {{base}}/api/v2/contracts/{{contractId}}/commands
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Idempotency-Key: example-payment-001

{"action":"pay","expected_version":{{revision}},"quote_id":"{{quoteId}}","confirmed":true}
